{"__ud_title":"个人 WebDAV 接入Vooh手册","__ud_tags":["Vooh"],"__ud_update_time":1790247759835,"__ud_create_time":1790247758232,"__ud_draft":false,"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1,"id":"个人-WebDAV-音源插件编写手册"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"个人 WebDAV 接入Vooh手册"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本文只面向"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"个人使用"},{"type":"text","text":"：把自己可访问的 WebDAV 音乐目录接入 Vooh，在自己的设备上浏览、搜索和在线播放。示例使用一个目录中的音频文件，重点是讲清插件协议。请将示例中的地址和凭据换成自己的私有服务配置。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"1-运行方式与准备"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"1. 运行方式与准备"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Vooh 从用户添加的 HTTP(S) 地址下载一个 JSON "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"订阅"},{"type":"text","text":"。订阅内同时包含插件声明（manifest）和完整 JavaScript 代码。App 校验整个订阅后才启用，并在本机缓存。插件调用宿主提供的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohHttp"},{"type":"text","text":" 请求 WebDAV；播放时插件返回音频地址和请求头，宿主负责媒体探测及播放。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"准备一个仅供本人访问的 WebDAV 目录，例如 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"https://dav.example.net/dav/music/"},{"type":"text","text":"。示例假设："}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"目录支持 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"PROPFIND"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"Depth: 1"},{"type":"text","text":"，返回标准 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"207 Multi-Status"},{"type":"text","text":" XML。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"音频文件支持带鉴权头的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"GET"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"Range"},{"type":"text","text":" 请求，且鉴权不会把请求重定向到另一个源站。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"音频文件直接放在该目录；示例不递归读取子目录。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"文件名包含可展示的曲名；示例不从文件标签中提取歌手或专辑。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"建议先用自己的 WebDAV 客户端确认这些条件。插件 HTTP 桥接目前允许 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"GET"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"POST"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"PUT"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"PATCH"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"DELETE"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"HEAD"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"PROPFIND"},{"type":"text","text":"。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohHttp"},{"type":"text","text":" 可发送文本或字节请求体，默认把响应作为文本返回；它不会把非 2xx 状态自动变成异常，因此插件需要检查 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"status"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"阅读路线：第 2、3、5 节可以完成最小插件；第 4 节集中列出当前插件协议的字段、所有能力方法及宿主桥接接口，不必再查阅其它协议文档。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"2-编写-pluginjs"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"2. 编写 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"plugin.js"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"以下是一个完整的"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"个人使用"},{"type":"text","text":"示例。把 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"ORIGIN"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"ROOT_PATH"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"AUTHORIZATION"},{"type":"text","text":" 改成自己的值。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"AUTHORIZATION"},{"type":"text","text":" 里的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"Basic"},{"type":"text","text":" 字符串是“用户名:密码”的 Base64 编码，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"并非加密"},{"type":"text","text":"；也可以按个人服务的要求改成 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"Bearer &lt;token&gt;"},{"type":"text","text":"。凭据始终固化在插件代码中，不应放入 Candidate、日志、错误消息或订阅 URL。"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"js"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"// 仅供个人使用：这些常量会原样进入订阅 JSON。\nconst ORIGIN = \"https://dav.example.net\";\nconst ROOT_PATH = \"/dav/music/\"; // 必须以 / 开头并以 / 结尾\nconst AUTHORIZATION = \"Basic REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_BASE64_CREDENTIALS\";\nconst ADAPTER_ID = \"personal_webdav\";\nconst PAGE_SIZE = 50;\nconst AUDIO_EXT = /\\.(mp3|m4a|aac|flac|wav|ogg)$/i;\n\nfunction xmlText(value) {\n  return value.replace(/&#(x[0-9a-f]+|[0-9]+);|&(amp|lt|gt|quot|apos);/gi,\n    (_, number, named) => {\n      if (number) {\n        const code = number[0].toLowerCase() === \"x\"\n          ? parseInt(number.slice(1), 16) : parseInt(number, 10);\n        return Number.isFinite(code) && code <= 0x10ffff\n          ? String.fromCodePoint(code) : \"\";\n      }\n      return {amp: \"&\", lt: \"<\", gt: \">\", quot: '\"', apos: \"'\"}[named.toLowerCase()];\n    });\n}\n\nfunction directAudioPath(href) {\n  // DAV:href 通常是绝对路径，也可能是同一源站的完整 URL。\n  let path = xmlText(href.trim());\n  if (path.startsWith(ORIGIN + \"/\")) path = path.slice(ORIGIN.length);\n  if (!path.startsWith(ROOT_PATH) || path.includes(\"?\") || path.includes(\"#\")) return null;\n  const tail = path.slice(ROOT_PATH.length);\n  if (!tail || tail.includes(\"/\") || path.length > 256) return null;\n  let filename;\n  try { filename = decodeURIComponent(tail); } catch (_) { return null; }\n  return AUDIO_EXT.test(filename) ? {path, filename} : null;\n}\n\nfunction parseListing(xml) {\n  // 这里只读取 DAV:response 中的 href 和 collection 标记；不依赖 XML 前缀名称。\n  const blocks = xml.match(/<(?:[\\w.-]+:)?response\\b[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/(?:[\\w.-]+:)?response\\s*>/gi) || [];\n  const result = [];\n  const seen = new Set();\n  for (const block of blocks) {\n    if (/<(?:[\\w.-]+:)?collection\\b/i.test(block)) continue;\n    const href = block.match(/<(?:[\\w.-]+:)?href\\b[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/(?:[\\w.-]+:)?href\\s*>/i);\n    if (!href) continue;\n    const file = directAudioPath(href[1]);\n    if (file && !seen.has(file.path)) {\n      seen.add(file.path);\n      result.push(file);\n    }\n  }\n  return result.sort((a, b) => a.filename.localeCompare(b.filename));\n}\n\nasync function listAudioFiles() {\n  const response = await voohHttp({\n    url: ORIGIN + ROOT_PATH,\n    method: \"PROPFIND\",\n    headers: {\n      Authorization: AUTHORIZATION,\n      Depth: \"1\",\n      \"Content-Type\": \"application/xml; charset=utf-8\"\n    },\n    body: '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?><d:propfind xmlns:d=\"DAV:\"><d:prop><d:resourcetype/></d:prop></d:propfind>'\n  });\n  if (response.status === 401 || response.status === 403) {\n    const error = new Error(\"个人 WebDAV 目录鉴权失败\");\n    error.code = \"authentication\";\n    throw error;\n  }\n  if (response.status !== 207) {\n    throw new Error(\"个人 WebDAV 目录读取失败，HTTP \" + response.status);\n  }\n  return parseListing(response.text);\n}\n\nfunction toCandidate(file) {\n  const title = file.filename.replace(AUDIO_EXT, \"\");\n  return {\n    source: {adapterId: ADAPTER_ID, sourceId: file.path},\n    track: {id: \"\", title, artists: [], album: \"\"}\n  };\n}\n\nfunction page(files, offset) {\n  const items = files.slice(offset, offset + PAGE_SIZE).map(toCandidate);\n  const next = offset + PAGE_SIZE;\n  return {items, ...(next < files.length ? {nextCursor: String(next)} : {})};\n}\n\nglobalThis.voohPlugin = {\n  async search({text, cursor}) {\n    const files = await listAudioFiles();\n    const query = String(text || \"\").trim().toLocaleLowerCase();\n    const matches = files.filter(file => file.filename.toLocaleLowerCase().includes(query));\n    const offset = /^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)$/.test(String(cursor ?? \"0\")) ? Number(cursor ?? 0) : 0;\n    return page(matches, offset);\n  },\n\n  async sections() {\n    return [{id: \"music\", title: \"我的 WebDAV 音乐\"}];\n  },\n\n  async collection({id}) {\n    if (id !== \"music\") return {items: []};\n    // 当前发现页调用 collection 时不传分页 cursor，故仅展示前 50 首。\n    return page(await listAudioFiles(), 0);\n  },\n\n  async resolve({source, candidate}) {\n    if (source?.adapterId !== ADAPTER_ID || typeof source.sourceId !== \"string\") {\n      throw new Error(\"歌曲来源无效\");\n    }\n    const file = directAudioPath(source.sourceId);\n    if (!file || file.path !== source.sourceId) throw new Error(\"文件路径无效\");\n    const selected = candidate && candidate.source?.adapterId === ADAPTER_ID &&\n      candidate.source?.sourceId === source.sourceId ? candidate : toCandidate(file);\n    return {\n      candidate: selected,\n      url: ORIGIN + file.path,\n      protocol: \"http\",\n      headers: {Authorization: AUTHORIZATION}\n    };\n  }\n};复制"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"此示例仅为个人目录的最小实现。它用轻量文本提取读取标准 DAV 列表；若个人服务返回复杂 XML（例如特殊命名空间、CDATA 或非标准 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"href"},{"type":"text","text":"），应替换为适合该服务的完整 XML 解析逻辑。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohHttp"},{"type":"text","text":" 的单次响应上限为 8 MiB，因此非常大的目录也需要拆分成多个个人目录或改为按需索引。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"3-声明-manifest-并生成订阅"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"3. 声明 manifest 并生成订阅"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"为这个例子创建 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"manifest.json"},{"type":"text","text":"："}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"json"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"formatVersion\": 1,\n  \"pluginId\": \"personal.webdav.music\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"hostApiRange\": {\"min\": 1, \"max\": 1},\n  \"engineTarget\": \"quickjs-2026-06-04-source\",\n  \"sourcePlatforms\": [\"personal_webdav\"],\n  \"capabilities\": [\"discover\", \"collection\", \"stream\"],\n  \"entrypoints\": {\"main\": \"plugin.js\"},\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"httpDomains\": [\"dav.example.net\"],\n    \"mediaDomains\": [\"dav.example.net\"]\n  }\n}复制"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"字段含义："}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"字段含义与本例取值"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"formatVersion"},{"type":"text","text":"订阅和 manifest 当前均为 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"1"},{"type":"text","text":"。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"pluginId"},{"type":"text","text":"插件实现的唯一 ID；可使用个人命名空间，更新时保持稳定。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"version主.次.修订"},{"type":"text","text":" 三段数字；更新插件时递增。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hostApiRange"},{"type":"text","text":"可运行的宿主 API 版本范围；当前例子为 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"1"},{"type":"text","text":"。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"engineTarget"},{"type":"text","text":"当前 JS 引擎目标，必须精确填写示例字符串。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"sourcePlatforms"},{"type":"text","text":"资源来源 ID；必须与 Candidate 的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"source.adapterId"},{"type":"text","text":" 一致。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"capabilities"},{"type":"text","text":"声明要用的能力；每项都必须导出相应方法。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"entrypoints"},{"type":"text","text":"当前入口固定为 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"{&quot;main&quot;:&quot;plugin.js&quot;}"},{"type":"text","text":"；代码实际嵌入订阅的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"code"},{"type":"text","text":" 字段。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"permissions"},{"type":"text","text":"描述 HTTP 和媒体目标域名，供宿主识别和诊断；"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"不是凭据或代码的保密边界"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"pluginId"},{"type":"text","text":" 须以小写字母开头，只能使用小写字母、数字、点、下划线和连字符，总长 2–64；"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"sourcePlatforms"},{"type":"text","text":" 中每个 ID 须以小写字母开头，只能使用小写字母、数字和下划线，总长 2–32。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hostApiRange"},{"type":"text","text":" 只含 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"min"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"max"},{"type":"text","text":"，且必须覆盖当前 API 版本 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"1"},{"type":"text","text":"。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"permissions"},{"type":"text","text":" 可省略；若填写，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"httpDomains"},{"type":"text","text":" 至少一个域名，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"mediaDomains"},{"type":"text","text":" 可为空数组。两者列出的域名只用于描述，不阻止插件实际访问其它 HTTP(S) 地址。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"streamRoutes"},{"type":"text","text":" 必须与 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"stream"},{"type":"text","text":" 一同声明；"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"metadataProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" 能力必须同时提供下文所述的 manifest 声明。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"订阅顶层只包含 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"formatVersion"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"name"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"plugins"},{"type":"text","text":"；每个插件条目包含 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"manifest"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"code"},{"type":"text","text":"。为了避免手工转义整段 JS，可在个人电脑上用 Python 标准库打包："}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"python"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"import json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nmanifest = json.loads(Path(\"manifest.json\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\ncode = Path(\"plugin.js\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\nbundle = {\n    \"formatVersion\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"我的个人 WebDAV 音乐\",\n    \"plugins\": [{\"manifest\": manifest, \"code\": code}],\n}\nPath(\"bundle.json\").write_text(\n    json.dumps(bundle, ensure_ascii=False, separators=(\",\", \":\")),\n    encoding=\"utf-8\",\n)复制"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"每份订阅可含 1–16 个插件；单个 JS 代码最多 2 MiB，全部代码最多 8 MiB，整个订阅最多 12 MiB。插件 ID 不得重复。订阅中的插件顺序，以及用户添加的订阅顺序，会影响同一来源有多个实现时的优先级。宿主在添加或刷新时会整体校验；刷新失败仍保留上一次有效缓存。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"订阅 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"name"},{"type":"text","text":" 须为非空文本，最长 100 字符；单个 App 最多保存 16 个订阅。订阅 URL 必须是 HTTP(S)，不得包含用户名密码或片段标识。添加时会下载并校验整份订阅和声明的 JS 方法，运行期间调用才会检查实际请求与返回数据。修改代码后需要重新打包、更新私有服务上的 JSON，并在 App 中刷新该订阅。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"4-接口逐项理解"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"4. 接口逐项理解"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"插件入口是 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"globalThis.voohPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" 对象。方法可以是 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"async"},{"type":"text","text":"，输入和输出都必须能被 JSON 序列化。声明的能力必须有对应方法；特别是 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"discover"},{"type":"text","text":" 要同时实现 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"search"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"sections"},{"type":"text","text":"，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"stream"},{"type":"text","text":" 对应 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"resolve"},{"type":"text","text":"。除 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"sections"},{"type":"text","text":" 可以直接返回数组、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"lyrics"},{"type":"text","text":" 可以直接返回字符串或 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"null"},{"type":"text","text":" 外，方法通常返回对象。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"Candidate-与来源"},"content":[{"type":"text