56 KiB；返回输出通常最多 1 MiB，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"playlistImport"},{"type":"text","text":" 最多 8 MiB。宿主会限制执行时间与内存，不能把全库音频内容读入 JS。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"其它可直接调用的全局函数："}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"函数输入 → 输出"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohCodec(&quot;base64Encode&quot;, byteArray)"},{"type":"text","text":" / "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohCodec(&quot;base64Decode&quot;, text)"},{"type":"text","text":"Base64 编码为字符串 / 解码为字节数组。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohCodec(&quot;hexEncode&quot;, byteArray)"},{"type":"text","text":" / "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohCodec(&quot;hexDecode&quot;, text)"},{"type":"text","text":"十六进制编码为字符串 / 解码为字节数组。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohCodec(&quot;utf8Decode&quot;, byteArray)"},{"type":"text","text":"UTF-8 字节数组解码为字符串。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohDigest(&quot;sha256&quot;, byteArray)"},{"type":"text","text":" / "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohDigest(&quot;md5&quot;, byteArray)"},{"type":"text","text":"计算摘要，返回字节数组；可用 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hexEncode"},{"type":"text","text":" 转成字符串。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"await voohSleep(milliseconds)"},{"type":"text","text":"异步等待，单次最长 30000 毫秒，仍受宿主调用时限约束。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohRandom(length)"},{"type":"text","text":"返回安全随机字节数组，最多 4096 字节。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohStoreGet(key)"},{"type":"text","text":" / "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohStoreSet(key, stringValue)"},{"type":"text","text":" / "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"voohStoreRemove(key)"},{"type":"text","text":"读取、写入或删除当前插件的少量持久状态。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"存储键只允许字母、数字、点、下划线、连字符，长度最多 128；值必须为字符串，UTF-8 编码后最多 4096 字节。每个插件最多 256 个键、总量最多 128 KiB。不要把个人 WebDAV 凭据复制到存储中。插件调用可能在新的 JS 运行环境中执行，不能依赖全局变量跨调用保存目录列表；需要跨调用保存的少量非敏感状态才使用存储。插件可通过 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"throw Object.assign(new Error(&quot;说明&quot;), {code:&quot;authentication&quot;})"},{"type":"text","text":" 报错；错误消息不要包含凭据，网络、超时和格式错误由宿主分别处理。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"可选为个人歌单增加导入解析能力"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"可选：为个人歌单增加导入解析能力"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"上面的完整 WebDAV 示例"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"没有实现"},{"type":"text","text":"歌单导入。只有想在自己的设备上解析歌单输入时，才需要在 manifest 的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"capabilities"},{"type":"text","text":" 中额外加入 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"&quot;playlistImport&quot;"},{"type":"text","text":"，并在同一个 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"globalThis.voohPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" 对象上导出 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"async playlistImport({text})"},{"type":"text","text":" 方法。App 只根据已成功加载插件的能力声明决定是否显示“导入歌单”入口；打开页面后，粘贴的文本才会传给该方法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下面以"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"本人整理的本地 JSON 歌单"},{"type":"text","text":"作接口形状演示。宿主原生支持从文件导入以下格式；如果想让插件处理粘贴到文本框里的同类 JSON，则由 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"playlistImport({text})"},{"type":"text","text":" 解析并映射到个人 WebDAV 文件："}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"json"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"formatVersion\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"我的个人歌单\",\n  \"tracks\": [\n    {\"title\": \"Example\", \"artists\": [], \"album\": \"\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Another\", \"artists\": [], \"album\": \"\"}\n  ]\n}复制"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":1,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"方法收到 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"{text}"},{"type":"text","text":"，先判断它是否为自己支持的 JSON 歌单格式。不属于时返回 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"{&quot;matched&quot;:false}"},{"type":"text","text":"，宿主会按订阅顺序尝试下一个声明了 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"playlistImport"},{"type":"text","text":" 的插件。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"属于时，插件读取 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"name"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"tracks"},{"type":"text","text":"，再将曲目逐一对应到"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"本人 WebDAV 目录中真实存在的文件"},{"type":"text","text":"。这个对应过程可依据本人维护的文件名或索引设计；找不到个人文件的曲目不应伪造 WebDAV 来源，可计入 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"issues"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对应成功的文件使用前文 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"toCandidate"},{"type":"text","text":" 所述的 Candidate 结构；"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"source.adapterId"},{"type":"text","text":" 必须在该插件的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"sourcePlatforms"},{"type":"text","text":" 内，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"source.sourceId"},{"type":"text","text":" 必须能由同一插件的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"resolve"},{"type":"text","text":" 找到并播放。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"返回预览对象；用户查看预览并确认后，宿主才会把这些曲目导入个人歌单。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"例如，把示例 manifest 的能力数组扩展为 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"&quot;capabilities&quot;: [&quot;discover&quot;, &quot;collection&quot;, &quot;stream&quot;, &quot;playlistImport&quot;]"},{"type":"text","text":"，保留 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"&quot;sourcePlatforms&quot;: [&quot;personal_webdav&quot;]"},{"type":"text","text":"。一次模拟匹配的返回值可以是："}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"json"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"matched\": true,\n  \"name\": \"我的个人歌单\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": {\"adapterId\": \"personal_webdav\", \"sourceId\": \"/dav/music/Example.mp3\"},\n      \"track\": {\"id\": \"\", \"title\": \"Example\", \"artists\": [], \"album\": \"\"}\n    }\n  ],\n  \"expectedCount\": 2,\n  \"complete\": false,\n  \"issues\": [\"第 2 首在个人 WebDAV 目录中没有对应文件，已跳过\"]\n}复制"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"matched"},{"type":"text","text":" 必须是布尔值。匹配时，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"name"},{"type":"text","text":" 为非空歌单名，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"items"},{"type":"text","text":" 为 Candidate 数组，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"complete"},{"type":"text","text":" 为布尔值；"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"expectedCount"},{"type":"text","text":" 可以省略或填原始曲目数，"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"issues"},{"type":"text","text":" 可以省略或填问题说明数组。"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"complete: false"},{"type":"text","text":" 适用于示例中只找到部分个人文件的情况。宿主会校验这些字段和来源平台；"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"items"},{"type":"text","text":" 最多 10,000 项，单次插件输出最多 8 MiB。页面的“导入 JSON”按钮由宿主直接解析本地文件，不调用 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"playlistImport"},{"type":"text","text":"。本人也可以手动整理其它网页中的个人列表内容，转换成上述合法 JSON 格式后再导入；这里不涉及网页解析实现。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"5-私有部署并在-App-中使用"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"5. 私有部署并在 App 中使用"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":1,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在本人的电脑上生成 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"bundle.json"},{"type":"text","text":"，核对其中 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"code"},{"type":"text","text":" 已包含正确的个人 WebDAV 地址和凭据；不要把生成文件或原始 JS 放到公开仓库。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"将 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"bundle.json"},{"type":"text","text":" 放在"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"仅本人设备可访问"},{"type":"text","text":"的 HTTP(S) 服务上，例如只在个人专用网络内可达的地址。订阅下载使用普通 GET；当前订阅地址不支持在 App 中另外配置鉴权请求头，也不接受 URL 用户信息。因此部署方式必须让本人设备能够直接读取该文件，同时阻止其他人读取。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 App 的搜索页输入该 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"bundle.json"},{"type":"text","text":" 的完整 URL 并提交，以添加插件订阅。App 会下载、校验并缓存订阅；启用后在发现页打开“我的 WebDAV 音乐”，或按文件名搜索，再点选歌曲在线播放。已添加的订阅可在设置中的插件来源页面刷新、停用或移除。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"修改目录地址或凭据后，重新打包并在 App 中刷新订阅。若校验或下载失败，查看订阅错误并修正；旧的有效缓存仍会保留。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"保密边界："},{"type":"text","text":" JSON 中的 JS 和固化凭据是可读文本，Basic 的 Base64 字符串也能还原。私有服务的访问控制、受限网络和对设备的保护，是防止他人取得订阅代码的必要条件。避免在构建日志、分享链接、故障截图中泄露订阅内容或凭据。私有部署无法保证拥有设备或订阅读取权限的人拿不到代码；若必须让别人取得订阅，就不能把其中的凭据视为秘密。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"6-排查顺序"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"6. 排查顺序"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"现象优先检查"},{"type":"text","text":"添加订阅失败订阅 URL 是否可由该设备直接 GET、JSON 是否有效、manifest 字段及能力方法是否对应。目录读取失败WebDAV 根路径末尾的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"/"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"PROPFIND"},{"type":"text","text":" 是否返回 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"207"},{"type":"text","text":"、个人服务的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"Depth: 1"},{"type":"text","text":" 行为及响应大小。鉴权失败固化的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"Authorization"},{"type":"text","text":" 值是否正确、服务是否将请求重定向到另一源站；跨源站重定向会移除鉴权头。目录为空音频是否位于根目录的直接子级、扩展名是否在示例列表中、DAV "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"href"},{"type":"text","text":" 是否采用可识别的形式。能看到歌曲但无法播放文件 GET/Range 是否可用、返回的是否是真实音频、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"resolve"},{"type":"text","text":" 的 Candidate 来源是否与请求一致。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"以上步骤均以个人 WebDAV 音乐库和个人设备为前提。需要更复杂的目录层级时，可以在理解基础接口后，分别设计目录索引与分页，而不必改变订阅和 Candidate 的基本形状。"}]}]}